== conditions
   source:     pre-encoded 720p25 mpegts, publishers use -c copy
   endpoints:  one media_srt_listen per worker, worker i binds entry i
   api:        listen ... reuseport; mutations retried until the owner
               answers, metrics read on the owner's own connection
   throughput: chunks/s and bytes/s are the workers' own drained totals
   cpu:        per thread, percent of one core, over the measured window
   receivers:  separate SRT/RTMP sinks, HLS readers and HLS PUT sink
   receiver CPU: sampled for external SRT, RTMP and HLS sink workers
   labels:     SRT:* from comm; this module's threads from a stack backtrace (attached and labelled)
   host:       single host, no netem, 10 cpus
